# Ferrell, Tsai & Yang (2011) Cell 144:874 -- one-variable CDK1/APC model.
# APC is assumed to follow CDK1 instantly (Hill function of CDK1), so
# APC activity = CDK1^n/(K^n + CDK1^n). One ODE: no oscillation possible;
# CDK1 settles to a stable steady state.
# CHECK the form and values against the paper's Figure 2 before reporting.
par a1=0.1, b1=3, K=0.5, n=8
CDK1'=a1 - b1*CDK1*CDK1^n/(K^n + CDK1^n)
init CDK1=0
@ total=25
done
